Third-party material
--------------------
Each entry lists: source URL, pinned commit or digest, licence, the folder it lives
in, and what we changed. Material we may not redistribute is never committed; it is
fetched at setup time by pinned digest (see docs/APPS.md, "run only").

Swag Labs (sample-app-web), vendored ("adopt")
  Source:   https://github.com/saucelabs/sample-app-web
  Commit:   ad62bb2d7950bc5747af46a75aa1fb1bd6b8622a (main, 28 Oct 2026)
  Licence:  MIT, Copyright (c) 2019 Sauce Labs. The full text is in
            apps/swag-labs/upstream/LICENSE (read on 5 Nov 2026).
  Folder:   apps/swag-labs/upstream
  Changed:  - Only the app source is kept: upstream test suites, Storybook, CI, git
              hooks, the Dockerfile, the CRA service worker and GitHub Pages files
              were removed; package.json and package-lock.json were trimmed to match.
            - Added @fontsource/dm-sans and @fontsource/dm-mono (OFL-1.1) so the
              fonts are bundled instead of loaded from Google Fonts.
            - Bench mode, marked "QA-BENCH:" in the source: generated accounts
              replace the built-in usernames; the built-in faulty users' behaviour
              is switched on by QA_BENCH_MUTATIONS; deliberate changes (relabel,
              seasonal banner, checkout copy, a price change) by QA_BENCH_CHANGES;
              error reports go to a local endpoint instead of Backtrace.
            The full list is in apps/swag-labs/upstream.json, "changes_from_upstream".

